{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"screens\": [\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S01\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S02\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S03\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S04\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S05\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S06\",\n      \"score\": 3,\n      \"wrong\": \"把孤单和酸涩进一步解释成了‘委屈’，完整稿没有被亏待、受委屈的意思，其核心是对方不知道他曾经有多害怕被嫌弃，因此产生了一点孤单。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S07\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S08\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S09\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S10\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S11\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S12\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S13\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S14\",\n      \"score\": 3,\n      \"wrong\": \"把‘不想再逼自己讨一句永远不变的保证’说成了‘不再要求对方保证永远不变’，改变了表达重心：原稿强调的是他不再逼迫自己索求保证，而不只是停止要求对方作出承诺。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"story\": 4,\n  \"story_note\": \"全曲故事与完整稿是同一件事：从小心翼翼地渴望亲近，到逐渐放松、坦然付出，再到意识到亲近可能失去，最终接受甜蜜与酸楚并存，不再强求永远不变的保证。局部有少量情绪和措辞偏差，但没有改变人物关系、心理发展或故事走向。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "f49591d9-cb2e-44d0-8606-e6f3f9f0d26b", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261111T231454192311Z", "elapsed_seconds": 66.656, "completed_utc": "2026-11-11T23:16:00.857851+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "req